# 基本図形編集をプロセスで: the menu (design 11.3), for tools/ui_run.py. A figure of 30
# small rectangles (mkbig) opened with the figure editor running as a process (pfig), saved
# as it is, everything taken and lined up with 位置あわせ (編集, its last row): its panel
# (SYSDEF_BOX_FIG panel 1, selector switches as the desktop's has them) taken with Enter, the
# left edges. Then 取消 (編集, its third row) takes it back: saved again, the record is the
# one saved first. The menu opens with the item chosen last on the pointer's row, the rows
# 20 apart; 編集's own menu opens beside it, its first row (トレー) on 編集's row when
# there is room under it, 取消 40 below; low on the screen it rises, as it does for 位置あわせ.
mkbig fig 30 4
logmark
pfig big
expectsincein 60 figure: opened 画用紙 shapes 32
wait 500
logmark
key 16 01
expectsince figure: saved (0)
sum
keep before
key 04 01
wait 300
logmark
click 300 400 1
expectsince figure: menu
wait 400
move 310 480
wait 400
move 420 480
wait 150
move 420 785
wait 300
click 420 785
expectsince figure: command align
wait 800
shot pfig_align
key 28
expectsince figure: align 1,0
wait 500
shot pfig_aligned
# 取消: 編集 is on the pointer's row now
logmark
click 300 400 1
expectsince figure: menu
wait 400
move 310 400
wait 400
move 420 400
wait 150
move 420 440
wait 300
click 420 440
expectsince figure: command undo
wait 500
shot pfig_undone
logmark
key 16 01
expectsince figure: saved (0)
sum
same before
key 08 01
expect figure: closed
absent !OACV!
